# ============================================
# OPTIONAL DEPLOY OVERRIDES
# ============================================
#
# The application itself reads:
# - backend/.env (backend + docker stack configuration)
# - frontend/.env.local (frontend configuration)
#
# This root .env stays optional for deploy-time overrides that are sourced by
# scripts/deploy_vps.sh on the VPS. Keep secrets in backend/.env unless the
# deploy script explicitly needs them here.
#
# Optional host-level Caddy overrides for the production VPS:
# CADDY_PRIMARY_SITE=vps-d4ce4beb.vps.ovh.net
# CADDY_FALLBACK_SITE=http://51.75.65.6
# CADDY_BACKEND_UPSTREAM=127.0.0.1:8000
# CADDY_TUSD_UPSTREAM=127.0.0.1:1080
# CADDY_FRONTEND_UPSTREAM=127.0.0.1:3000
